WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.636
Camotán plot, read by a computer voice.

2
00:00:02.886 --> 00:00:08.925
Soil: watch. The satellite saw 2 months with little cover, none bare.

3
00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:13.555
Burning: repeats. Fires seen nearby in 3 of 15 years.

4
00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:19.698
Midsummer drought: watch. Dry spells longer than 15 days in 2 of 25 years.

5
00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:24.131
We can't say which option is best: SMAP soil moisture is missing.

6
00:00:24.381 --> 00:00:27.435
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
